WEBVTT

00:07.170 --> 00:09.000
Kenji!

00:09.090 --> 00:10.420
Please stop!

00:18.140 --> 00:21.520
Please, stop this...

00:33.150 --> 00:35.240
When you're in high school,

00:35.320 --> 00:39.030
sometimes you really want what other people have...

00:39.120 --> 00:42.290
I know the feeling. I was the same way myself.

00:42.370 --> 00:46.290
But I'd say throwing your friend off a moving vehicle

00:46.380 --> 00:49.340
and killing him is going a bit too far.

00:49.920 --> 00:52.050
I didn't kill him...

00:54.590 --> 00:57.140
I didn't kill anyone!

00:57.220 --> 00:59.180
Sorry, wrong answer.

01:10.650 --> 01:12.610
Want some more?

01:13.740 --> 01:16.900
You're the ones who killed them...

01:16.990 --> 01:19.530
Bzzzt. Wrong again.

01:19.620 --> 01:24.660
If you don't get it right soon,
we'll have to ask your pretty sister next.

01:38.220 --> 01:41.430
You'll sign a confession admitting to the murder?

01:43.430 --> 01:44.810
Okay...

03:33.540 --> 03:35.330
Kenji!

03:44.180 --> 03:45.890
Don't worry about me...

03:48.560 --> 03:52.140
You should thank your brother
for being so devoted to you.

04:09.160 --> 04:13.000
Yesterday night, on Highway 135 in Kasahara,

04:13.080 --> 04:16.000
a 10-member gang was
arrested for using illegal vehicles

04:16.080 --> 04:19.670
and committing violent acts against citizens.

04:19.760 --> 04:24.090
Two minors, male and female,
were among the group, adding to...

04:24.180 --> 04:28.430
The number you have dialed
currently cannot be reached,

04:28.510 --> 04:31.640
as it is either out of
signal range or is not turned on.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.980
Well?

04:34.060 --> 04:36.400
No luck. I can't reach her.

04:36.480 --> 04:40.270
Don't worry. We don't know if it was Rin or not yet.

04:44.110 --> 04:47.450
I always knew this would happen!

04:47.530 --> 04:48.820
Kawai!

05:08.930 --> 05:10.550
Urgh!

05:11.180 --> 05:14.020
Hishida! Can I ride the Balon?!

05:14.100 --> 05:15.850
The Balon?

05:15.940 --> 05:17.600
What are you saying?

05:18.650 --> 05:22.440
I need to do something to take my mind off this...

05:23.440 --> 05:26.740
--No problem, then.
--You, too?!

05:26.820 --> 05:30.620
Sitting around with gloomy
looks won't change anything.

05:30.700 --> 05:33.290
We know Rin would never do anything bad.

05:33.370 --> 05:38.710
Even if she was arrested, it was
because of a mistake. She'll be fine.

05:38.790 --> 05:40.330
I have faith in it.

05:42.420 --> 05:47.090
Besides, we should continue
our club's activities as usual;

05:47.180 --> 05:53.350
we can't let people use these terrorist
attacks as excuses to vilify RideBacks.

05:53.430 --> 05:56.230
No, we have to continue!

05:56.850 --> 05:59.400
We have to!

05:59.480 --> 06:01.190
Geez, you guys...

06:06.030 --> 06:12.120
Try not to go too fast.
Today's activities are canceled if the Balon breaks.

06:12.200 --> 06:13.950
I'll try my hardest! Safety first!

06:14.040 --> 06:16.000
Okay, here I go!

06:34.310 --> 06:36.390
<i>Rond de Jambe!</i>

06:38.520 --> 06:39.600
What was that?!

06:39.690 --> 06:41.480
Yes, that's more like it!

06:41.560 --> 06:44.230
You look best when you're smiling, Shoko.

06:51.160 --> 06:52.450
Shoko!

06:52.530 --> 06:55.240
Hey! Don't let go!

07:14.300 --> 07:17.970
Yesterday night, on Highway 135 in Kasahara...

07:18.060 --> 07:23.440
I had my brother look into it.
It was definitely Ogata they caught.

07:24.480 --> 07:28.360
Her brother is in custody for
inflicting bodily harm resulting in death.

07:28.440 --> 07:33.030
It doesn't look good; the top brass
of the GGP seem to be involved.

07:37.580 --> 07:38.910
Okakura.

07:41.120 --> 07:44.170
Can I ask a blunt question?

07:45.250 --> 07:47.210
Who are you?

07:50.630 --> 07:53.550
...newly-deployed police RideBacks in Sendai

07:53.640 --> 07:56.930
have cracked down on motorcycle gangs.

07:57.010 --> 08:01.430
Unlike the earlier prototypes,
the RideBacks used were--

08:01.520 --> 08:03.310
--police RideBack squad in Chiba

08:03.400 --> 08:05.810
caught illegal vehicles
believed to be terrorist RideBacks.

08:05.900 --> 08:07.730
One police officer was injured--

08:07.820 --> 08:10.730
There appears to be
a vocal group criticizing the GGP's

08:10.820 --> 08:14.240
aggressive handling of
the police RideBacks' introduction.

08:14.320 --> 08:17.910
Indeed. However, in terms of counter-terrorism,

08:17.990 --> 08:22.450
I believe this method is
already proving to be quite effective.

08:23.000 --> 08:28.540
It appears there is pressure for police
RideBacks on the local level as well.

08:28.630 --> 08:31.260
Yes, especially in suburban cities...

08:31.340 --> 08:33.590
Additional deployments have been confirmed

08:33.680 --> 08:36.300
for Yokohama, Sendai, Kobe, and Miyazaki.

08:36.390 --> 08:39.600
Only 13 more cities until our goal of 30.

08:39.680 --> 08:41.020
You can't go in!

08:42.680 --> 08:44.350
It's an emergency.

08:47.310 --> 08:49.440
There's no problem. You may go.

08:57.030 --> 09:00.700
That was a rather aggressive entrance,
Senior Superintendent Kataoka.

09:00.790 --> 09:02.540
What is the meaning of this?

09:02.620 --> 09:04.580
Exactly what it says.

09:04.660 --> 09:07.080
You're extending Rin Ogata's length of confinement

09:07.170 --> 09:09.960
and placing her under the GGP's jurisdiction...

09:11.500 --> 09:15.800
You say we're working together
while ignoring us completely?!

09:15.880 --> 09:20.180
I make the decisions. That's how I do things.

09:36.200 --> 09:40.120
It was more like major
housecleaning than a house search.

09:40.200 --> 09:45.330
They even turned Kenji's
incredibly messy room upside-down.

09:45.410 --> 09:47.080
It was really something.

09:47.170 --> 09:49.460
Oh...

09:54.260 --> 09:55.380
Rin.

09:57.220 --> 10:01.050
I believe you.

10:01.140 --> 10:03.100
Stay strong.

10:04.100 --> 10:05.350
Time is up.

10:06.980 --> 10:09.900
Kenji is a nice boy.

10:09.980 --> 10:11.610
I must ask you to leave now.

10:13.190 --> 10:14.610
Don't give in!

10:30.250 --> 10:36.340
<i>All I wanted to do was save Shoko and Kenji...</i>

10:37.590 --> 10:40.180
<i>But I wound up hurting complete strangers...</i>

10:41.010 --> 10:43.100
<i>What would you have done, Mom?</i>

10:43.890 --> 10:47.470
<i>Please, stop dancing and tell me...</i>

11:54.920 --> 11:56.880
You've been chosen.

11:58.250 --> 12:00.670
Chosen? By who?

12:01.670 --> 12:04.050
To use your strength.

12:04.840 --> 12:10.310
Who chose me? What for?
What do you mean by "strength"?

12:10.390 --> 12:14.060
To fight. To be victorious.

12:16.480 --> 12:19.020
To defeat your enemies.

12:34.210 --> 12:37.840
The GGP's strategy is to
maintain control by using military might.

12:37.920 --> 12:41.260
In that regard, I support the anti-GGP movement.

12:41.340 --> 12:44.630
I see. There is speculation that
the infamous RideBack girl incident

12:44.720 --> 12:47.720
was actually concocted by the GGP itself...

12:47.800 --> 12:48.930
Rin...

12:49.010 --> 12:50.260
Why?

12:51.310 --> 12:55.640
Why isn't the GGP saying anything about her?

13:33.220 --> 13:34.930
Just come out already.

13:42.360 --> 13:44.320
How long did you know?

13:54.370 --> 13:55.750
This is the Fuego's...

14:00.080 --> 14:01.630
I leave the rest to you.

14:02.670 --> 14:04.170
What are you going to do?

14:04.260 --> 14:06.220
Stir up old ghosts.

14:21.730 --> 14:23.860
This is a terrible environment for you.

14:23.940 --> 14:27.860
Let's finish this quickly so you
can receive more humane treatment.

14:27.950 --> 14:33.330
We should be able to move you
to the GGP facility by this weekend.

14:34.490 --> 14:37.200
Do you have any requests
regarding your present situation?

14:38.750 --> 14:40.250
...go.

14:40.330 --> 14:41.380
Come again?

14:42.750 --> 14:44.460
I don't want to go.

14:48.680 --> 14:53.760
Please don't get the wrong idea here.
You have no choice in the matter.

15:02.060 --> 15:05.880
Erasing files

15:26.710 --> 15:29.510
--What's the matter?!
--He's gone...

15:37.310 --> 15:39.270
Pull your right hand out slowly.

15:40.850 --> 15:42.140
Stop.

15:44.270 --> 15:48.230
Tell Romanov that the Goblin is coming to say hello.

16:02.870 --> 16:05.420
And then he disappeared?

16:05.500 --> 16:08.590
Shall I put out a warrant for Tenshiro Okakura?

16:08.670 --> 16:12.880
There's no need. I can't bother
with every drama someone puts on.

16:17.890 --> 16:20.560
The heroic Goblin is long dead.

16:22.850 --> 16:25.940
Confirm your belongings and sign for them here.

17:00.600 --> 17:01.890
What's the problem here?

17:08.400 --> 17:09.560
Damn--!

17:48.520 --> 17:52.110
<i>Please, don't get involved with me any more...</i>

18:08.620 --> 18:12.250
What you're seeing now was sent in by a viewer.

18:12.340 --> 18:15.130
It's a little fuzzier than
what we aired the other day,

18:15.210 --> 18:18.010
but the full situation can still be seen in detail.

18:18.090 --> 18:21.760
Most important is the armored GGP vehicle in the back.

18:21.850 --> 18:25.640
This makes it clear that the GGP was involved...

18:24.850 --> 18:30.670
RideBack girl appears to have escaped from custody

18:25.730 --> 18:28.900
Hello, Sato?! Are you seeing this?!

18:31.820 --> 18:33.070
This is breaking news.

18:33.150 --> 18:36.860
The underage suspect held in
police custody for the incident in Kasahara

18:36.940 --> 18:39.860
appears to have been kidnapped
by the anti-GGP terrorist group BMA

18:39.950 --> 18:43.160
while being transferred to the GGP headquarters.

18:43.240 --> 18:45.660
At least five people were killed in the attack.

18:45.750 --> 18:49.210
An emergency warning was issued just moments ago.

18:49.290 --> 18:51.670
Because the abducted suspect was also believed

18:51.750 --> 18:54.130
to have had a part in the TV Tower bombing incident,

18:54.210 --> 18:57.260
authorities had taken unusual measures for a minor.

18:57.340 --> 18:59.420
The BMA issued this message.

18:59.510 --> 19:01.510
We are the BMA.

19:01.590 --> 19:04.890
We have rescued the "RideBack girl,"

19:04.970 --> 19:08.060
wrongfully arrested for being an anti-GGP terrorist,

19:08.140 --> 19:11.900
from the clutches of the tyrannical GGP.

19:13.900 --> 19:15.860
Twenty minutes have passed since the incident

19:15.940 --> 19:20.150
and all details remain unknown,
including the safety of the suspect.

19:20.240 --> 19:25.660
Although the BMA message refers
to the abductee as the "RideBack girl,"

19:25.740 --> 19:30.790
the GGP will not comment on the matter,
due to the inability to confirm it.

19:32.290 --> 19:35.170
They can't even bring one girl here?

19:36.090 --> 19:39.550
What is the intelligence agency doing?!

19:39.630 --> 19:40.510
What is it?

19:40.590 --> 19:44.260
Okakura has shown himself,
but it appears the BMA is tailing him.

19:44.350 --> 19:45.470
What should we do?

19:47.310 --> 19:50.730
This is a rare opportunity.
Let's let them lead the way.

20:08.910 --> 20:11.040
Lieutenant Goblin, yes?

20:11.120 --> 20:16.000
Why are terrorists so
interested in the RideBack girl now?

20:17.130 --> 20:20.960
Lieutenant Kiefer is waiting. Please come with us.

20:22.130 --> 20:26.930
I see. So Ogata was just
a scapegoat to get my attention?

20:52.330 --> 20:55.670
Target is moving southwest at 80 kph.

20:55.750 --> 20:59.750
Transferring pursuit to Unit 8 on the ground.

21:42.000 --> 21:43.590
You're...

21:53.640 --> 21:55.270
We meet again.

21:56.730 --> 22:01.400
Even when he laughs

22:03.400 --> 22:08.990
I'm thinking of you before I realize it

22:12.030 --> 22:17.040
And the hands holding his

22:18.830 --> 22:24.300
feel your warmth, too

22:26.470 --> 22:30.220
Even if I cut out my recollections

22:30.300 --> 22:34.180
and drive them out of my heart

22:34.270 --> 22:37.930
or try to kick the memories out

22:38.020 --> 22:42.400
I still think of you

22:42.480 --> 22:46.900
Time now passes and seasons fly by

22:46.990 --> 22:50.740
Even if that smile starts to become hazy

22:50.820 --> 22:54.740
my heart will never forget you

22:54.830 --> 22:58.500
(even if we can never meet again)

22:58.580 --> 23:02.330
Even if I knock over photos of us smiling

23:02.420 --> 23:06.760
or try to hide my overflowing feelings

23:07.720 --> 23:10.970
my heart will never forget

23:11.680 --> 23:14.930
my memories with you

23:26.030 --> 23:41.020
New Suzuri Theatre

23:26.610 --> 23:32.120
--Isn't this the preview?
--Yeah! Hishida was so useless and dumb!

23:32.200 --> 23:33.660
Sorry. I'm no good, either.

23:33.740 --> 23:37.750
Huh?! Are you just jealous that
you've never gotten to drive a RideBack?!

23:35.870 --> 23:39.560
Next Episode:

23:35.870 --> 23:39.560
Get Ride! The Chosen One

23:37.830 --> 23:39.290
Don't get a big head!
